{"id":"161f0473a5123eab","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-realizer-finite-types.md","title":"实现性使用的含积有限类型","display":"df-realizer-finite-types — 实现性使用的含积有限类型","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-realizer-finite-types","aliases":["72-df-realizer-finite-types"],"display":"df-realizer-finite-types — 实现性使用的含积有限类型","depends_on":[],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI §3.1, print429–430/PDF441–442","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source type constructors and simultaneous recursion checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-realizer-finite-types"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-realizer-finite-types</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-realizer-finite-types — 实现性使用的含积有限类型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI §3.1, print429–430/PDF441–442"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source type constructors and simultaneous recursion checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在 ZFC 中用三个互异标签构造有限自由树；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf n\">\\(\\mathbf n\\)</span> 是数类型标签，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_r,\\times_r\">\\(\\Rightarrow_r,\\times_r\\)</span> 为类型构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\)</span> 在合法位置遍历下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{RT}\">\\(\\mathcal{RT}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y^X\">\\(Y^X\\)</span> 是全部集合函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_\\sigma\">\\(\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\)</span> 与默认元素 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_\\sigma\">\\(d_\\sigma\\)</span> 同时按有限类型树递归。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf n&amp;:=\\langle0,0\\rangle,\\quad\n\\sigma\\Rightarrow_r\\tau:=\\langle1,\\langle\\sigma,\\tau\\rangle\\rangle,\\quad\n\\sigma\\times_r\\tau:=\\langle2,\\langle\\sigma,\\tau\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\nU_0&amp;:=\\{\\mathbf n\\},\\quad U_{m+1}:=U_m\\cup\\{\\sigma\\Rightarrow_r\\tau,\\sigma\\times_r\\tau:\\sigma,\\tau\\in U_m\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal{RT}:=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}U_m,\\\\\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathbf n}&amp;:=\\omega,\\quad \\mathcal D_{\\sigma\\times_r\\tau}:=\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\times\\mathcal D_\\tau,\\quad\n\\mathcal D_{\\sigma\\Rightarrow_r\\tau}:=\\mathcal D_\\tau^{\\mathcal D_\\sigma},\\\\\nd_{\\mathbf n}&amp;:=0,\\quad d_{\\sigma\\times_r\\tau}:=\\langle d_\\sigma,d_\\tau\\rangle,\\quad\nd_{\\sigma\\Rightarrow_r\\tau}:=\\{\\langle a,d_\\tau\\rangle:a\\in\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf n&amp;:=\\langle0,0\\rangle,\\quad\n\\sigma\\Rightarrow_r\\tau:=\\langle1,\\langle\\sigma,\\tau\\rangle\\rangle,\\quad\n\\sigma\\times_r\\tau:=\\langle2,\\langle\\sigma,\\tau\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\nU_0&amp;:=\\{\\mathbf n\\},\\quad U_{m+1}:=U_m\\cup\\{\\sigma\\Rightarrow_r\\tau,\\sigma\\times_r\\tau:\\sigma,\\tau\\in U_m\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal{RT}:=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}U_m,\\\\\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathbf n}&amp;:=\\omega,\\quad \\mathcal D_{\\sigma\\times_r\\tau}:=\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\times\\mathcal D_\\tau,\\quad\n\\mathcal D_{\\sigma\\Rightarrow_r\\tau}:=\\mathcal D_\\tau^{\\mathcal D_\\sigma},\\\\\nd_{\\mathbf n}&amp;:=0,\\quad d_{\\sigma\\times_r\\tau}:=\\langle d_\\sigma,d_\\tau\\rangle,\\quad\nd_{\\sigma\\Rightarrow_r\\tau}:=\\{\\langle a,d_\\tau\\rangle:a\\in\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这采用第 VI 章包含积类型的版本，不把第 V 章现有纯箭头类型集合静默改变。全类型结构的各载体是集合，且默认元素的归纳证明保证全部非空，不依赖任意选择。全部集合函数的语义不等于可计算函数或封闭 System T 项的语义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_r,\\times_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{RT}","display":false},{"tex":"Y^X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"d_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf n&:=\\langle0,0\\rangle,\\quad\n\\sigma\\Rightarrow_r\\tau:=\\langle1,\\langle\\sigma,\\tau\\rangle\\rangle,\\quad\n\\sigma\\times_r\\tau:=\\langle2,\\langle\\sigma,\\tau\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\nU_0&:=\\{\\mathbf n\\},\\quad U_{m+1}:=U_m\\cup\\{\\sigma\\Rightarrow_r\\tau,\\sigma\\times_r\\tau:\\sigma,\\tau\\in U_m\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal{RT}:=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}U_m,\\\\\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathbf n}&:=\\omega,\\quad \\mathcal D_{\\sigma\\times_r\\tau}:=\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\times\\mathcal D_\\tau,\\quad\n\\mathcal D_{\\sigma\\Rightarrow_r\\tau}:=\\mathcal D_\\tau^{\\mathcal D_\\sigma},\\\\\nd_{\\mathbf n}&:=0,\\quad d_{\\sigma\\times_r\\tau}:=\\langle d_\\sigma,d_\\tau\\rangle,\\quad\nd_{\\sigma\\Rightarrow_r\\tau}:=\\{\\langle a,d_\\tau\\rangle:a\\in\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2127,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-159","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations]] · [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]] · [[72-df-modified-realizer-type]] · [[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]] · [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]] · [[72-thm-combinatory-abstraction-beta]] · [[72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence]] · [[72-thm-kleene-first-pca]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-full-truth]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-witness]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity]]"},{"id":"caae2f23e6ca3d53","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"类型与编号、配对取 [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]]、[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]。$e,d,a,b,u,v\\in\\omega$，$\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{RT}$。"},{"id":"23e6be89fc7cf486","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{RT},\\mathbf n,\\times_r,\\Rightarrow_r$ 取 [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]]；固定编号、数值配对 $p$ 及逆投影 $p_0,p_1$ 取 [[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]。$\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{RT}$。下式按类型树定义 $\\operatorname{HRO}_\\sigma\\subseteq\\omega$。"},{"id":"604f716378c63109","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"数学对象语法取 [[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]，类型取 [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]]；$t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a$，$i\\in\\omega$。$\\mathcal M_a$ 是下式给出的无析取算术片段，$A,B\\in\\mathcal M_a$；$\\operatorname{rt}$ 按公式树递归。"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations]] · [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]] · [[72-df-modified-realizer-type]] · [[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]] · [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]] · [[72-thm-combinatory-abstraction-beta]] · [[72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence]] · [[72-thm-kleene-first-pca]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-full-truth]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-witness]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-529","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations]] · [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]] · [[72-df-modified-realizer-type]] · [[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]] · [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]] · [[72-thm-combinatory-abstraction-beta]] · [[72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence]] · [[72-thm-kleene-first-pca]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-full-truth]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-witness]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity]]"}],"outgoing":[]}